*-----------------------*                                                       
                                                                                
  REPORT LISTA41                +                                               
         PRINTER W56049D0       +                                               
         LINESIZE 205           +                                               
         SPACE 0                +                                               
         NOHEADING              +                                               
         NOSPREAD               +                                               
         NOADJUST               +                                               
         PAGESIZE 32767         +                                               
         NODATE                                                                 
                                                                                
